      "message": "[warning] Line 1269: 🟡 `applyRemoteDelta()` now calls `reconcileAuthorshipColors()` unconditionally, and when colors are disabled that function still scans/rewrites the entire document via `clearBackgroundBrush()`. This is O(document fragments) on every remote edit and can degrade collaborative typing on large docs. Gate reconciliation to when authorship colors are enabled, and clear backgrounds only once when transitioning from enabled → disabled.",
