      "message": "[error] Line 1251: 🔴 The line-number gutter is positioned from document coordinates (`modelData.y`) but does not compensate for editor scrolling (`editor.contentY`), so numbers drift out of alignment as soon as the document scrolls. Include `editor.contentY` in the model dependencies and render with `y: modelData.y + editor.topPadding - editor.contentY` (or place the gutter inside the scrolling content item) so line numbers stay aligned with visible lines.",
